1
00:00:00,953 --> 00:00:03,123
(Bernadette:)...he's putting a lot of pressure on me
to get a prenup.

2
00:00:03,622 --> 00:00:05,082
- Ouch!
- Yeah.

3
00:00:05,291 --> 00:00:08,671
(Bernadette:)- Howie's gonna freak out.
- Parental pressure can be daunting.

4
00:00:08,877 --> 00:00:12,297
(Amy:)I remember the battle with my mother
about shaving my legs.

5
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:16,130
(Amy:)Last year, I finally gave in
and let her do it.

6
00:00:18,679 --> 00:00:21,099
(Bernadette:)I just don't know
how I'm gonna break it to him.

7
00:00:21,307 --> 00:00:24,397
I'm a believer in breaking bad news
to a guy when you're in bed.

8
00:00:24,601 --> 00:00:27,311
(Penny:)That's how I told my high school
boyfriend I slept with his brother.

9
00:00:28,814 --> 00:00:30,894
(Penny:)That's how I told his brother
the same thing.

10
00:00:32,818 --> 00:00:35,278
(Bernadette:)I don't know.
I don't wanna manipulate him with sex.

11
00:00:35,487 --> 00:00:37,617
(Penny:)Oh, sweetie, that's what sex is for.

12
00:00:39,116 --> 00:00:41,786
(Amy:)The connection between marriage
and money is nothing new.

13
00:00:41,952 --> 00:00:44,662
The term "wed" referred
to the money and livestock...

14
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:46,580
(Amy:)...the groom paid the bride's father.

15
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:50,210
(Amy:)For example, you're adorable,
intelligent and a good earner.

16
00:00:50,419 --> 00:00:54,209
(Amy:)I could conservatively see you going
for at least two oxen and a goose.

17
00:00:56,258 --> 00:01:02,018
(Amy:)You would fetch a unicorn.

